<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>疫苗 on 编程那些事儿</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E7%96%AB%E8%8B%97/</link><description>Recent content in 疫苗 on 编程那些事儿</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:31:03 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E7%96%AB%E8%8B%97/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>疫苗与旅行健康：打疫苗、旅行前咨询、疟疾预防药、带药出入境</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/health/vaccines-and-travel-health/</link><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/health/vaccines-and-travel-health/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;在美国，打疫苗大多数时候&lt;strong&gt;不用去医院、也不用约医生&lt;/strong&gt;——楼下的药房就行。CVS、Walgreens 这类连锁药房都能打，&lt;strong&gt;多数不用预约，走进去排队就行&lt;/strong&gt;，刷保险常常是 $0。所以听到 &lt;code&gt;I'm here for a flu shot. Do I need an appointment?&lt;/code&gt; 这种问题，药师的回答通常是 &lt;code&gt;Nope, walk-ins are fine.&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>